# chosen - one alone (2) is refused, and the Phoenix cannot be chosen to pay for itself - and the Phoenix returns to the battlefield
# tapped (a new object, CR 400.7) as a 3/3 with Flying. Both Strikes are exiled; the Lotus stays in the graveyard.

